Implement user story AMSD-2041: [GO, UP, MX] Live Preview of Content in CMS

## Story Description
[GO, UP, MX] Live Preview of Content in CMS — Enable content editors to see real-time previews of their draft changes in the CMS. When the app is opened in Contentstack's live-preview mode, it must fetch and render draft content, reactively update when the editor modifies fields, and gracefully handle connection failures. Normal published-content behavior must remain unchanged when preview mode is not active.

